{"id": "3270918", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3270918", "title": "Ferestra\u0219 chinezesc", "text": "Ferestra\u0219ul chinezesc (\"Mergus squamatus\") este o specie tipic\u0103 de ferestra\u0219 (genul \"Mergus\") pe cale de dispari\u021bie. Tr\u0103ie\u0219te \u00een Manciuria \u0219i \u00een extremitatea sud-estic\u0103 a Siberiei, se reproduce \u00een nord \u0219i ierneaz\u0103 \u00een sud."}
