{"id": "3271404", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3271404", "title": "Presur\u0103 somalez\u0103", "text": "Presura somalez\u0103 (\"Emberiza poliopleura\") este o specie de pas\u0103re din familia Emberizidae, care se g\u0103se\u0219te \u00een Etiopia, Kenya, Somalia, Sudanul de Sud, Tanzania \u0219i Uganda. Habitatele sale naturale sunt savana uscat\u0103 \u0219i arbu\u0219tii subtropicali sau tropicali, fiind de obicei observat\u0103 \u00een perechi."}
